      mp3: 
      ms: 5520
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | curious, open-minded economist host who loves a puzzle; warm, thinks aloud, brisk lively pace (never slow, never rushed); takes objections seriously, never preachy #ctx:1i8zptk'
    '|b||The curve''s slope is Nora''s own deal: how many coffees she''d give for one more supper. Economists call it the marginal rate of substitution.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 9120
      voice: 'gemini:Kore | sharp, friendly co-host: asks what a smart listener would, pushes back with real objections, sometimes explains; dry wit, never exaggerated; brisk lively pace, never slow #ctx:oq3nma'
    '|a||At A her curve is steep. For a second supper, she''d give up as many as nine coffees.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 6400
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | curious, open-minded economist host who loves a puzzle; warm, thinks aloud, brisk lively pace (never slow, never rushed); takes objections seriously, never preachy #ctx:1r4gpc7'
    '|b||And the shop only asks two. A bargain she should take, again and again.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 5200
      voice: 'gemini:Kore | sharp, friendly co-host: asks what a smart listener would, pushes back with real objections, sometimes explains; dry wit, never exaggerated; brisk lively pace, never slow #ctx:mx4935'
    '|b||Nora is at C: nine suppers, two coffees. Should she buy more suppers, or fewer?':
      mp3: 
      ms: 6040
      voice: 'gemini:Kore | sharp, friendly co-host: asks what a smart listener would, pushes back with real objections, sometimes explains; dry wit, never exaggerated; brisk lively pace, never slow #ctx:1opz6so'
    '|b||Fewer. At C a supper is worth almost nothing to her in coffees, and the shop pays two for each one she gives up.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 6880
      voice: 'gemini:Kore | sharp, friendly co-host: asks what a smart listener would, pushes back with real objections, sometimes explains; dry wit, never exaggerated; brisk lively pace, never slow'
    '|a||At C it''s the reverse. She''d let a supper go for a quarter of a coffee, and the shop gives her two.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 6320
      voice: gemini:Achird | curious, open-minded economist host who loves a puzzle; warm, thinks aloud, brisk lively pace (never slow, never rushed); takes objections seriously, never preachy
    '|a||At B the two deals agree: a supper is worth two coffees to her, and it costs two coffees. No swap helps.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 7720
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | curious, open-minded economist host who loves a puzzle; warm, thinks aloud, brisk lively pace (never slow, never rushed); takes objections seriously, never preachy #ctx:3gnyrh'
    '|b||So in words: keep swapping until what the last supper is worth to you equals what it costs.':
      mp3: 
