      voice: 'gemini:Kore | sharp, friendly co-host: asks what a smart listener would, pushes back with real objections, sometimes explains; dry wit, never exaggerated; brisk lively pace, never slow #ctx:1xjy1m5'
    '|a||In 1854 a Prussian civil servant, Hermann Gossen, made it a law: spend so the last coin brings the same pleasure everywhere.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 8480
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | curious, open-minded economist host who loves a puzzle; warm, thinks aloud, brisk lively pace (never slow, never rushed); takes objections seriously, never preachy #ctx:1pjbzzy'
    '|a||His book flopped, and was found again only in 1878.':
      mp3: 
