      voice: 'gemini:Achird | curious, open-minded economist host who loves a puzzle; warm, thinks aloud, brisk lively pace (never slow, never rushed); takes objections seriously, never preachy #ctx:16k1z1l'
    '|b||And here''s the quiet consequence. Everyone who shops at these prices ends up valuing the last supper at two coffees.':
