      voice: 'gemini:Kore | sharp, friendly co-host: asks what a smart listener would, pushes back with real objections, sometimes explains; dry wit, never exaggerated; brisk lively pace, never slow #ctx:1w554ua'
    '|a||So no swap between any two of them would help either. The prices line everybody up, without anyone ever meeting.':
