      voice: 'gemini:Achird | curious, open-minded economist host who loves a puzzle; warm, thinks aloud, brisk lively pace (never slow, never rushed); takes objections seriously, never preachy #ctx:1vxtbmc'
    '|a||There''s a short calculation behind B. Show the math, or skip it?':
